  "limitations": [
    "Discovery starts from Alpaca's current all-status asset census and current exchange metadata, so this is not a point-in-time causal market sample.",
    "Nine of 12 selection decisions occur exactly at 07:00 ET from completed 06:59 bars, so this remains a session-open acquisition-boundary stress sample rather than representative scanner-qualified traffic.",
    "Float, news and full cross-sectional rank are absent from cohort selection.",
    "The UPXI case here is 2025-08-13 and is not the retrospective Ross benchmark case dated 2025-04-21.",
    "Selection ranks completed-bar decision availability, while in-window replay can use causal SIP intraminute refinement within the eligible source minute; a 06:59 refinement before strategy session start is rejected in favor of the 07:00 fallback.",
    "The 60-second completed-bar rule models calculability after bar completion, not exchange, SIP, provider or network dissemination latency.",
    "The conditional cohort cannot estimate full-scanner false-positive rate, imitation quality, trade quality or realized P&L.",
    "Plans and modeled fills are rolling diagnostic opportunities, not portfolio trades."
  ],
